Archive comments from a linked Instagram account

Usage:
  msgvault source instagram-comments [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Register a linked Instagram account
  sync        Archive Instagram comments and replies

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for instagram-comments

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')

Use "msgvault source instagram-comments [command] --help" for more information about a command.
